	(text "Supplies (RP2350 datasheet 6.3.7): IOVDD, QSPI_IOVDD, USB_OTP_VDD, ADC_AVDD and VREG_VIN on +3V3, the\nAP2112K LDO that rises with +5V; the core regulator switches VREG_LX through 3.3 uH onto DVDD (VREG_FB senses\nit), its analog supply VREG_AVDD through 33R / 4.7 uF.  One 100 nF at every supply pin, drawn at the pin it serves.\nRESET pulls RUN low.  Hold BOOTSEL while pressing RESET for the RP's USB boot ROM.  The S3 board has no RUN /\nBOOTSEL wires to this cart: it can only ask running firmware for BOOTSEL over USB.  SWD and RUN on bring-up pads.\nQSPI_SD0-3 / SCLK unused: the 2 MB flash is in the package."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 71.12 17.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "920ddc2b-bf43-5904-bec0-4e51f4057eb9")
	)
	(embedded_fonts no)
